   "conclusion": {
    "diagnosis": "Jobs 11, 12, and 13 all failed inspection while jobs 1-10 all passed (E2, H3 at 0.95). All three failing jobs passed through CNC-06 immediately before inspection (E3, E7), and CNC-06 was fine for job 10 (finished 999, passed at 1000) but jobs 11-13 failed after using it. CNC-05's following_error is stable across the batch boundary (E4 vs E9), which argues against CNC-05 (H2, only 0.20) and against a sudden CNC-05 mechanical fault. The root cause is not yet confirmed: CNC-06 is the prime suspect as the last machine before inspection, but I have no sensor data for CNC-06. Confidence in any specific causal fix is below 0.90, so I cannot intervene yet. One targeted sensor check on CNC-06 could confirm or rule it out and change the recommendation.",
